arbeitnow:graduate-technology-strategy-a:
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class="public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr" data-offset-key="7pi8n-0-0"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key="7pi8n-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-text="true"&gt;Introduction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class="public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr" data-offset-key="7pi8n-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key="8mbk-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-text="true"&gt;Are you a recent or soon-to-be graduate in chemistry, physics, engineering or a related field, excited to put your scientific knowledge and curiosity to work on real-world business issues? Are you interested in&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="style_handle__4nndx style_hasReplacements__2Gq83 style_feminine__2TtJP"&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key="8mbk-1-0"&gt;&lt;span data-text="true"&gt;understanding&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key="8mbk-2-0"&gt;&lt;span data-text="true"&gt; why some scientific breakthroughs change the world, while other promising technologies struggle to make it into everyday life? Are you fascinated by how things are made, how people use them and how we can shape a more sustainable future?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="" data-block="true" data-editor="5vjqq" data-offset-key="deb83-0-0"&gt;
&lt;div class="public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr" data-offset-key="deb83-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key="deb83-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-text="true"&gt;Do you enjoy exploring complex questions, making &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="style_handle__4nndx style_hasReplacements__2Gq83 style_feminine__2TtJP"&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key="deb83-1-0"&gt;&lt;span data-text="true"&gt;connections&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key="deb83-2-0"&gt;&lt;span data-text="true"&gt; between ideas and working with others to find thoughtful, practical solutions? Would you like to help businesses &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="style_handle__4nndx style_hasReplacements__2Gq83 style_feminine__2TtJP"&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key="deb83-3-0"&gt;&lt;span data-text="true"&gt;understand&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key="deb83-4-0"&gt;&lt;span data-text="true"&gt; not just what technology can do, but how it can make a meaningful difference?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="" data-block="true" data-editor="5vjqq" data-offset-key="ep4de-0-0"&gt;
&lt;div class="public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr" data-offset-key="ep4de-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key="ep4de-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-text="true"&gt;If so, this could be a great role for you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr" data-offset-key="ep4de-0-0"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3 class="public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr" data-offset-key="5iecq-0-0"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key="5iecq-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-text="true"&gt;Who we are&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class="" data-block="true" data-editor="5vjqq" data-offset-key="81njs-0-0"&gt;
&lt;div class="public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr" data-offset-key="81njs-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key="81njs-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-text="true"&gt;A key part of Cambridge Consultants, our Advisory team works with clients across Consumer, Energy &amp;amp; Industrial, Telecommunications, Biotech, Healthcare and Defence &amp;amp; Security. Our clients range from early start-ups to global organisations, all looking for ways to use emerging technologies to address &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="style_handle__4nndx style_hasReplacements__2Gq83 style_masculine__1PshY"&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key="81njs-1-0"&gt;&lt;span data-text="true"&gt;challenges&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key="81njs-2-0"&gt;&lt;span data-text="true"&gt;, create new possibilities and make a positive impact in their markets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="" data-block="true" data-editor="5vjqq" data-offset-key="22qof-0-0"&gt;
&lt;div class="public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr" data-offset-key="22qof-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key="22qof-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-text="true"&gt;Our role is to help them navigate uncertainty, explore opportunities and turn promising ideas into practical outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="" data-block="true" data-editor="5vjqq" data-offset-key="4r1go-0-0"&gt;
&lt;div class="public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr" data-offset-key="4r1go-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key="4r1go-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-text="true"&gt;We provide research and insights to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="style_handle__4nndx style_hasReplacements__2Gq83 style_feminine__2TtJP"&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key="4r1go-1-0"&gt;&lt;span data-text="true"&gt;support&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key="4r1go-2-0"&gt;&lt;span data-text="true"&gt; important business choices relating to deep tech. This includes go-to-market strategies, investment &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="style_handle__4nndx style_hasReplacements__2Gq83 style_feminine__2TtJP"&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key="4r1go-3-0"&gt;&lt;span data-text="true"&gt;support&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key="4r1go-4-0"&gt;&lt;span data-text="true"&gt;, competitor &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="style_handle__4nndx style_hasReplacements__2Gq83 style_masculine__1PshY"&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key="4r1go-5-0"&gt;&lt;span data-text="true"&gt;analysis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key="4r1go-6-0"&gt;&lt;span data-text="true"&gt;, market insights, technology road-mapping and strategic foresight. The technologies we explore span exciting developments in biotech, quantum sensing and computing, robotics and physical AI, among many others.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr" data-offset-key="4r1go-0-0"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3 class="public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr" data-offset-key="g8h9-0-0"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key="g8h9-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-text="true"&gt;Your role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class="" data-block="true" data-editor="5vjqq" data-offset-key="dvl0j-0-0"&gt;
&lt;div class="public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr" data-offset-key="dvl0j-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key="dvl0j-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-text="true"&gt;This role sits within the Research &amp;amp; Insights section of our Advisory group. We explore how emerging technologies and future trends might shape the choices businesses make today, helping our clients feel better equipped to navigate change and plan for the future.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="" data-block="true" data-editor="5vjqq" data-offset-key="5g7ik-0-0"&gt;
&lt;div class="public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr" data-offset-key="5g7ik-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key="5g7ik-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-text="true"&gt;You might investigate what people will value in the next generation of products, explore how cleantech can be adopted at scale, or uncover where novel sensors could create new possibilities for businesses and their customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="" data-block="true" data-editor="5vjqq" data-offset-key="20t3t-0-0"&gt;
&lt;div class="public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr" data-offset-key="20t3t-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key="20t3t-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-text="true"&gt;It's an opportunity to combine scientific thinking, creative exploration and commercial &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="style_handle__4nndx style_hasReplacements__2Gq83 style_feminine__2TtJP"&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key="20t3t-1-0"&gt;&lt;span data-text="true"&gt;understanding&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key="20t3t-2-0"&gt;&lt;span data-text="true"&gt; to help answer questions that don't always have straightforward answers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr" data-offset-key="20t3t-0-0"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
