&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="" data-block="true" data-editor="5vjqq" data-offset-key="fummn-0-0"&gt;
&lt;div class="public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr" data-offset-key="fummn-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key="fummn-0-0"&gt;&lt;span data-text="true"&gt;We welcome applications from people with diverse backgrounds, experiences and perspectives. You don't need to meet every requirement to be a strong candidate. If the role sparks your curiosity and you'd enjoy exploring how science and technology can make a difference, we'd love to hear from you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: center;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;By submitting an application to Cambridge Consultants, you confirm that the information provided in this application, together with any supporting documentation, is true, complete, and accurate to the best of your knowledge and belief. You understand that any false statement, misleading information, or material omission may render you liable to disqualification from the recruitment process, withdrawal of any offer of employment, or dismissal without notice if discovered following appointment. You acknowledge that the organisation reserves the right to verify the information supplied.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: center;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:staff-engineer-fullstack-actio:
&lt;div class="content-intro"&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Staffbase&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We inspire people to achieve great things together. Our mission is to help organizations unlock the power of inspirational communication with the first &lt;strong&gt;AI-native Employee Experience Platform&lt;/strong&gt;. Our&lt;strong&gt; industry-leading and award-winning agentic AI communications channels&lt;/strong&gt; - intranet, employee app and email solutions - create engaging experiences that connect and empower employees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in Chemnitz, Germany and New York City, with offices in Berlin, London, Sydney, Tokyo, Prague, and Minneapolis–St. Paul, our diverse team of 550+ employees supports 1,500+ customers—reaching over 14 million employees—in transforming their employee experience.&lt;br&gt;We are proud to be a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type="bold"&gt;Unicorn&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;company—privately valued at over $1 billion—demonstrating strong growth, innovation, and lasting impact in our industry. Together, we’re shaping the future of workplace communication.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;As a Fullstack Staff Engineer on the Actions team, you'll take on one of our most important platform challenges: defining how extensibility works across Staffbase. Today, extensions power everything from HR integrations to the actions our AI assistant, Navigator, performs on a user's behalf — but there's no single, easy way to build and extend. That's what you'll design.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Your north star is a framework that our engineers, our Labs team, and eventually customers themselves can use to build their own extensions, whether that's a one-off integration for a single customer or a tier-one capability used across our entire base. You'll build the core, define the standards, and make the calls on where we standardise versus where we stay flexible, all on a mature, multi-tenant platform.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;This is a role for someone who wants to drive, not just deliver, shaping the direction of a genuinely open-ended problem and setting the technical foundations others will build on.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;As part of our tech stack, we are using: React.js, JavaScript, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Kotlin, Go, Java, MongoDB, Terraform, Docker and Playwright, to name a few.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Working with skilled and like-minded professionals in a team that values diversity and inclusivity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;We aim to create a flexible and agile work environment that promotes the well-being and work-life balance of our employees&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;We believe that team events during working hours play a vital role in building an exceptionally effective team, and we encourage them&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;We are enthusiastic about technology and committed to using it to improve the world&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;We follow the “You build it, you run it” approach and take pride in it&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;The Actions team sits at the heart of Staffbase's AI ambitions. We're the team that gives Navigator — our AI assistant and the main entry point into Staffbase — the ability to actually do things: submit a form, complete a task inside an integration, or take an action on a user's behalf through the agent. If Navigator is the brain, we build the hands.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;That means two big things. First, we enrich what the AI can see and act on, our plugins, our widgets and the wider Staffbase platform so the assistant can do real work, not just talk about it. Second, we build the extensions that connect to the tools people already use, like Workday, Personio, ServiceNow and Microsoft.   We're not just shipping features, though. A core part of our mission is building the extensibility framework that lets others build too.  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Working with skilled and similar-minded professionals in a team that values diversity and inclusivity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;We aim to create a flexible and agile work environment that promotes the well-being and work-life balance of our employees.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;We are enthusiastic about technology and committed to using it to improve the world.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;We follow the "You build it, you run it" approach and take pride in it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you'll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Define and drive Staffbase's extensibility strategy, designing the framework, SDK and standards that let our teams and customers build their own extensions and integrations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Build the core systems that enable our AI assistant to take action across Staffbase and connect to external providers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Lead technical strategy and architecture&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Influence technical decisions and their documentation, driving long-term sustainable solutions to accommodate future growth and requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Continuously improve and refine our development processes, CI/CD pipeline, and automation practices to foster a productive development experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Take ownership of major technical decisions, proactively addressing system bottlenecks and ensuring product quality&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Contribute to and maintain technical roadmaps with engineering leadership to align project priorities and business goals&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Manage and prioritize projects and initiatives across multiple teams&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Foster a culture of ownership, technical excellence and continuous improvement within the team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Role modeling and developing others in the craft of Product Software Engineering&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Mentor and guide engineers, providing leadership, feedback and fostering growth through code reviews and technical discussions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you need to be successful&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Proven track record as a Staff Engineer or Technical Lead with strong leadership and problem-solving skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Proven experience designing and building extensibility within a B2B / enterprise platform, SDKs, plugin systems, or extension frameworks that let internal teams and external customers build on top of a core product, with the judgment to define what "good" extensibility looks like from the ground up&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Deep understanding of multi-tenant architecture, with strong judgment on where to standardise versus where to stay flexible in platform design&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Extensive experience with Java/Kotlin or Go on the backend and React on the frontend&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Knowledge of architecture and design patterns&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Strong problem-solving skills and ability to work collaboratively in a fast-paced, dynamic environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Ability to drive technical direction, including making decisions on architectural trade-offs and evaluating the long-term impact of technical choices&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Experience managing architecture projects across multiple development teams, aligned with their roadmaps and stakeholders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Strong communication skills with the ability to articulate complex technical concepts to various stakeholders, both technical and non-technical&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Previous experience working alongside Product and Design Leaders to deliver customer value in an Agile environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Passion for building high-quality software&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Passion for diversity and inclusion, and the ability to foster a culture where the team can move forward at speed while ensuring that everyone's voice is heard and they can contribute their best&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you'll get&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Competitive Compensation&lt;/em&gt; - we offer attractive salary packages including LTIP (unit-based Long Term Incentive Plan)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 14pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Flexibility &lt;/em&gt;- we offer flexible working time models and the option of hybrid work, and support this with a yearly flex work allowance of €1560&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Recharge&lt;/em&gt; - with 31 vacation days annually (incl. one floating holiday), plus pro rata fully paid Fridays off during August&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 14pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Support&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;-&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;we offer offering a company pension scheme&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 14pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Volunteers Day&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;- you’ll get one day off per year for supporting a social project&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;img src="https://imgur.com/a/kIbq0q5" alt="" style="max-width: 100%;"&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:senior-partner-engineer-london:
&lt;div class="content-intro"&gt;&lt;h2 style="font-family: GothamBold,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; color: #662d91;"&gt;Teamwork makes the stream work.&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 style="font-family: GothamBold,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Roku is changing how the world watches TV&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roku is the #1 TV streaming platform in the U.S., Canada, and Mexico, and we've set our sights on powering every television in the world. Roku pioneered streaming to the TV. Our mission is to be the TV streaming platform that connects the entire TV ecosystem. We connect consumers to the content they love, enable content publishers to build and monetize large audiences, and provide advertisers unique capabilities to engage consumers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;From your first day at Roku, you'll make a valuable - and valued - contribution. We're a fast-growing public company where no one is a bystander. We offer you the opportunity to delight millions of TV streamers around the world while gaining meaningful experience across a variety of disciplines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle="heading 2"&gt;About the team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:320,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:140}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;The Partner Engineering team’s vision is to establish Roku as the preferred platform of choice for our partners (media companies) to distribute and monetize their content globally. The Partner Engineering team’s mission is to be the technical advocate and point of contact for the Partner’s Engineering organization within Roku to help them deliver the best content viewing experience globally for the Roku user community. On a day-to-day basis, we work with engineers from partners organization to help them develop, test, certify, and launch partners direct-to-consumer (DTC) apps in compliance with the Roku platform distribution agreement. We represent partners’ roadmap and technical needs by working cross-functionally with the assigned Partner Engagement Managers,&amp;nbsp;product and engineering teams within Roku.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle="heading 2"&gt;About the role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:320,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:140}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Roku's platform is live across the multiple European&amp;nbsp;countries, and our European footprint is growing — through Roku TV licensing partners, through our own streaming hardware, and through the local broadcasters and streaming services that make the platform worth owning in each market.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;You will be the senior engineer for our European partners: the person who makes their apps fast, stable and certifiable on Roku, who represents their technical constraints to our platform and OS teams, and who makes each new market launch a technical success rather than a scramble.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;You will be the engineer for a portfolio of European partners — public service and commercial broadcasters, subscription streaming services and pay-TV operators — working with the Partner Engineering team in San Jose and with the Partner Engagement Manager in London who owns those partners’ relationships. You will debug crashes, memory and launch-time issues, diagnose partner-reported streaming problems, and give your partners hands-on support through Roku certification.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;How you’ll work with the Partner Engagement Manager.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt; The Partner Engagement Manager from Roku owns the partner relationship, the launch plan and timeline, partner priorities, and communication during incidents. You own the technical diagnosis, the integration work, and technical sign-off on certification and launch readiness, working engineer to engineer with the partner’s technical team. When something breaks, the Partner Engagement Manager coordinates the response and keeps the partner informed; you find the root cause and the path to a fix.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Level: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Senior individual contributor, with no direct reports.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Reports to: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Director, Partner Engineering, based in San Jose.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Location and work arrangement: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;London, UK, in the office Monday to Thursday, with flexible Fridays. Travel within Europe up to 40% of your time. Regular late-afternoon calls with San Jose, whose working day starts at 4pm UK time.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;On-call: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;For major partner launches and live events, the Partner Engagement Manager is the on-call escalation point and brings this role in for technical diagnosis, which can mean occasional work outside normal hours.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Expected impact: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;European partners’ apps pass certification and launch without technical surprises. Additionally, you’ll own the stability, performance and engagement metrics for your partners' apps, and keep each at or better than its benchmark: Roku's certification thresholds and the best-performing apps on the platform.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="11" data-list-defn-props="{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559683&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559684&amp;quot;:-2,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}" data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1"&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Stability: crash rate, unexpected app closures and out-of-memory terminations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="11" data-list-defn-props="{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559683&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559684&amp;quot;:-2,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}" data-aria-posinset="2" data-aria-level="1"&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Performance: launch time, video start time, video start and playback failures, and rebuffering&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="11" data-list-defn-props="{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559683&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559684&amp;quot;:-2,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}" data-aria-posinset="3" data-aria-level="1"&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Engagement: streaming hours per subscriber&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="11" data-list-defn-props="{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559683&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559684&amp;quot;:-2,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}" data-aria-posinset="4" data-aria-level="1"&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;App Certification and public release: time from technical onboarding to launch in each new market&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="11" data-list-defn-props="{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559683&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559684&amp;quot;:-2,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}" data-aria-posinset="5" data-aria-level="1"&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Incidents: platform-caused incidents affecting your partners' apps, and time to resolve them&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle="heading 2"&gt;What &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle="heading 2"&gt;you'll&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle="heading 2"&gt; do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:320,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:140}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle="heading 3"&gt;European market expansion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:220,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Sign off the technical readiness of each new market launch.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt; The Partner Engagement Manager owns the launch plan and timeline; you work with Channel Publishing and Certification to get global and local broadcasters and streaming services onto the platform ahead of a market opening — scoping integrations, running technical onboarding, and clearing the issues that would otherwise surface on launch day. Then write down what “technically ready” meant for that market, so the next launch is faster and cheaper.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:460,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:280}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Represent regional technical requirements inside Roku engineering.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt; European partners hit constraints that do not exist in North America: built-in broadcast TV tuners on Roku TVs, accessibility obligations, rules on how prominently European content is shown, privacy rules for viewing data, and regional differences in content protection and delivery. You will work out what each means technically, and turn it into concrete platform requirements, feature requests and firmware bugs — and follow them to resolution. You don’t need to be an expert in each regulation but should be capable to work cross-functionally with Roku legal, product, engineering to drive these requests to resolution,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:460,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:280}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Help European partners integrate Roku Pay,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt; working with Roku technical teams: you advise partners on their integration, debug it, and test European purchase flows for multi-currency pricing, VAT and invoicing expectations, strong customer authentication (PSD2/SCA) at purchase and re-authentication, and local payment method coverage.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:460,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:280}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Resolve platform issues on Roku TV and operator devices in Europe.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt; When a TV maker’s or operator’s hardware makes partner apps misbehave, you reproduce the problem, measure which devices and apps it affects, and work it to a fix with Roku engineering teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:460,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:280}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle="heading 3"&gt;Core Partner Engineering&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:220,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Diagnose and resolve partner app defects end to end&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt; — BrightScript/SceneGraph and TypeScript crashes, memory pressure, launch-time and playback-start regressions, general performance problems, and Roku Search integration issues. When the cause is in the partner’s app, you agree the fix with their engineers, who change their own code; you prototype or suggest the patch where it helps. When it’s in the Roku platform, you file it with a reproducible case and work the fix with the team that owns it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:460,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:280}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Debug streaming and playback problems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt; across DASH and HLS, from manifest and DRM issues to playback problems on physical hardware.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:460,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:280}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Drive adoption of AI-assisted app development to lower partners' total cost of building on Roku. Help partners' engineers use AI coding assistants with Roku's developer tools to build, debug and certify apps faster, feed what you learn back into those tools, and measure the savings in time to certify and engineering effort per release.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:460,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:280}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Get partner apps through Roku certification.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt; When an app fails on launch time, memory, crash rate or playback, you find the root cause and agree the fix with the partner’s engineers, rather than relaying the result. Roku’s certification team runs the review; you give the technical sign-off that the app is ready.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:460,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:280}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Own the technical side of partner escalations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt; from first report to resolution, finding the root cause and driving the fix with the firmware, media, platform and channel publishing teams, and keeping the Partner Engagement Manager and the partner’s engineers informed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:460,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:280}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle="heading 2"&gt;What success looks like in your first year&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:320,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:140}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;By 90 days:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt; you’re the engineer for a portfolio of European partners, can debug and profile their apps on your own, and have taken at least one partner defect from first report to root cause.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:460,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:280}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;By 6 months:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt; European partners ask for you by name. You have carried a certification escalation to resolution and turned at least one European constraint into platform work that Roku engineering is delivering.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:460,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:280}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;By 12 months:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt; you have signed off the technical readiness of a new market launch or a major Roku TV partnership, your partners’ apps stay within Roku’s thresholds for launch time, memory and crash rate, and the market-readiness playbook you wrote is what the next engineer uses.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:460,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:280}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle="heading 2"&gt;What &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle="heading 2"&gt;we're&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle="heading 2"&gt; looking for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:320,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:140}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle="heading 3"&gt;Required&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:220,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;7+ years in software engineering, with meaningful time spent debugging and optimizing applications on constrained or embedded platforms — smart TV, set-top box, mobile or games console.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:460,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:280}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Proven AI-assisted coding experience: regular, hands-on use of AI coding tools (e.g., Claude, Copilot, Cursor, OpenCode) in real development work, with specific examples of AI tools used in production workflows.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:460,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:280}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Strong practical debugging skill: you are comfortable taking an ambiguous “the app is slow on this TV” report and working it down to a root cause with logs, traces and telemetry.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:460,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:280}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Working knowledge of adaptive streaming — DASH and/or HLS — and the failure modes around manifests, DRM and fMP4 playback.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:460,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:280}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Experience in a partner-, customer- or developer-facing engineering role, with the judgement to know what to share, when to escalate, and how to say no to an external stakeholder without damaging the relationship.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:460,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:280}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Comfort with data: SQL against large telemetry datasets, and a habit of quantifying impact before proposing a fix.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:460,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:280}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Proficiency in at least one of C/C++, Python or JavaScript/TypeScript, and willingness to become fluent in BrightScript.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:460,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:280}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Based in or able to work from our London office Monday to Thursday, with availability to travel within Europe up to 40% of the time.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:460,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:280}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle="heading 3"&gt;Strongly preferred&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:220,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Direct experience with European broadcast or streaming: working at or with a public service broadcaster, commercial broadcaster, European subscription streaming service, or pay-TV operator.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:460,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:280}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Familiarity with European platform and regulatory context — DVB and HbbTV broadcast standards, the European Accessibility Act, the Audiovisual Media Services Directive (AVMSD), GDPR as it applies to viewing data, or strong customer authentication (PSD2/SCA) in payment flows.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:460,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:280}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Experience launching a product or platform into a new country or region, with exposure to the technical, regulatory and partner-onboarding work that involves.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:460,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:280}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Professional working proficiency in a second European language — German, French or Spanish are the most immediately useful.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:460,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:280}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Prior work on smart TV platforms, embedded Linux, or media pipelines.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:460,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:280}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h6&gt;#LI-ST1&lt;/h6&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: GothamBold, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;"&gt;What's Roku's approach to hybrid working?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roku fosters an inclusive and collaborative environment where teams generally work in the office Monday through Thursday. Fridays are generally flexible for remote work, except for employees whose specific roles or assigned office location require five days' a week attendance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 style="font-family: GothamBold,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What are some of the benefits?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roku is committed to offering a diverse range of benefits as part of our compensation package to support our employees and their families. Our comprehensive benefits include global access to mental health and financial wellness support and resources. Local benefits include statutory and voluntary benefits which may include healthcare (medical, dental, and vision), life, accident, disability, commuter, and retirement options (401(k)/pension). Employees are supported in taking time off, in accordance with local leave policies and other personal needs to support their evolving work and life needs. It's important to note that not every benefit is available in all locations or for every role. For details specific to your location, please consult with your recruiter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 style="font-family: GothamBold,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accommodations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roku welcomes applicants of all backgrounds and provides reasonable accommodations and adjustments in accordance with applicable law. If you require reasonable accommodation at any point in the hiring process, please direct your inquiries to &lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 style="font-family: GothamBold,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What should I know about Roku's culture?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roku is a great place for people who want to work in a fast-paced environment where everyone is focused on the company's success rather than their own. We try to surround ourselves with people who are great at their jobs, who are easy to work with, and who keep their egos in check. We appreciate a sense of humor. We believe a fewer number of very talented folks can do more for less cost than a larger number of less talented teams. We're independent thinkers with big ideas who act boldly, move fast and accomplish extraordinary things through collaboration and trust. In short, at Roku you'll be part of a company that's changing how the world watches TV. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a unique culture that we are proud of. We think of ourselves primarily as problem-solvers, which itself is a two-part idea. We come up with the solution, but the solution isn't real until it is built and delivered to the customer. That penchant for action gives us a pragmatic approach to innovation, one that has served us well since 2002. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To learn more about Roku, our global footprint, and how we've grown, visit &lt;a href="https://www.weareroku.com/factsheet"&gt;https://www.weareroku.com/factsheet&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By providing your information, you acknowledge that you want Roku to contact you about job roles, that you have read Roku's &lt;a href="https://www.weareroku.com/roku-job-applicant-privacy-notice-for-job-applicants"&gt;Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;, and understand that Roku will use your information as described in that notice. If you do not wish to receive any communications from Roku regarding this role or similar roles in the future, you may unsubscribe at any time by emailing &lt;a ----- -----<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:forward-deployed-engineer-bris:
&lt;div class="content-intro"&gt;&lt;p&gt;Insight Enterprises, Inc. is a Fortune 500 Solutions Integrator helping organizations accelerate transformation by unlocking the power of people and technology. We architect, build and manage solutions for complex IT environments to deliver outcomes that contribute to our clients' success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our portfolio of digital transformation services includes deep expertise in cloud, data, AI, cybersecurity and intelligent edge. These services, augmented by Insight's longstanding relationships with 6,000+ technology partners across the globe, enable us to deliver the right technical solutions quickly and effectively. We're rated as a Great Place to Work, a Forbes Best Employer for Diversity and a Forbes World's Top Female-Friendly Company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role:&lt;/strong&gt; Forward Deployed AI Engineer&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Bristol HQ – Hybrid Model &amp;amp; Travel across EMEA region&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary:&lt;/strong&gt; DOE&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced AI Forward Deployed Engineer to lead the design, delivery and scaling of high-impact AI solutions for strategic customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a senior, hands-on technical role for someone who thrives at the intersection of software engineering, applied AI and customer problem-solving. You will turn complex and often ambiguous business challenges into secure, scalable and commercially viable AI solutions, taking ownership from early discovery and rapid prototyping through to production deployment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work directly with partners and customers as a senior technical contributor, working alongside Solution Architects and multidisciplinary teams to make pragmatic technical decisions and solve difficult implementation problems. This is an individual-contributor technical leadership role, with significant influence but no formal line-management responsibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the technical delivery of complex AI engagements, owning implementation, deployment approach, technical risk and engineering priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with customers and senior stakeholders to translate ambiguous business challenges into practical AI solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rapidly prototype, test and iterate AI solutions with customers to validate assumptions, feasibility and value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build and deploy production-grade generative AI, agentic and other applied AI solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remain hands-on throughout delivery, contributing code, integrations, evaluations and technical implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work alongside Solution Architects to translate customer requirements and constraints into appropriate solution designs and implementation approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate AI capabilities with enterprise systems, data, APIs, workflows and security models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish appropriate approaches for AI evaluation, observability, guardrails, human oversight and operational monitoring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diagnose and resolve complex technical problems encountered when deploying AI into customer environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct design and code reviews while mentoring engineers and improving technical capability across the practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Sales, Solutions Engineering, Product, Research, Architecture and Customer Success to align strategy and resolve delivery dependencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create reusable frameworks, accelerators, playbooks and solution patterns from customer delivery experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure solutions meet appropriate security, privacy, legal, responsible AI, governance and enterprise risk requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explain complex AI and engineering concepts clearly to technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute customer insight and implementation learning to Insight’s AI services, capabilities and go-to-market approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience Required:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience delivering software, AI, machine learning or applied AI solutions within complex, customer-facing enterprise environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong software engineering capability using languages such as Python or TypeScript/JavaScript.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience building solutions using modern foundation models, LLM APIs and associated AI platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience with generative AI patterns including RAG, tool/function calling, structured outputs and agentic workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing evaluation approaches covering AI quality, reliability, safety and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience integrating AI solutions with enterprise data, APIs, applications and workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience deploying and operating AI solutions using platforms such as Azure or AWS, or within customer-controlled environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of AI application architecture, orchestration, model selection, context management, observability and LLM operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of production engineering practices, solution architecture, security, testing and maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to operate effectively where requirements are incomplete or ambiguous, using experimentation and iterative delivery to converge on solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience working directly with senior customer stakeholders while maintaining strong technical credibility with engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial awareness and judgement to balance customer value, technical risk, delivery speed and scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience creating reusable technical frameworks, components, standards or delivery patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A degree in Computer Science, Software Engineering, Data Science, AI or a related discipline, or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A commitment to continuous learning, responsible AI and staying current with developments in AI technology, governance and market expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What success looks like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will turn difficult customer problems into secure, scalable and high-quality AI solutions that create demonstrable value in production. Your work will reduce delivery risk and turn customer implementation learning into reusable capabilities that can be applied across customers, industries and geographies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success will also be reflected in production adoption, strong technical stakeholder feedback, repeat or expanded customer engagements, improved engineering capability and the consistent adoption of reusable frameworks and delivery playbooks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6% Matched pension&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual salary reviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days holiday + bank holidays + 5 day buy/sell/carry over scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Health Insurance through Vitality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eye care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Electric car and cycle to work schemes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1 month work from EMEA policy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear growth and progression plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High street brand &amp;amp; gym discounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;p&gt;To see more roles, &lt;a href="https://amdaris.com/jobs" target="_blank"&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:solution-engineer-rennes-ille-:
&lt;div class="content-intro"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class="fabric-text-color-mark" data-renderer-mark="true" data-text-custom-color="#36b37e"&gt;IDnow is a&lt;strong&gt; leader in digital identity and fraud prevention in Europe&lt;/strong&gt; with a mission to transform trust into the most powerful asset in the digital world, empowering enterprises with &lt;strong&gt;AI-driven, SaaS-based identity solutions that deliver scalable security, adaptive compliance, and real-time fraud prevention&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark="true"&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class="fabric-text-color-mark" data-renderer-mark="true" data-text-custom-color="#36b37e"&gt;Through its broad portfolio of digital identity and fraud prevention solutions, IDnow establishes, maintains and enriches trust throughout the customer journey, ensuring businesses can confidently and securely operate while leveraging digital identity to drive growth, security and scalability. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class="fabric-text-color-mark" data-renderer-mark="true" data-text-custom-color="#36b37e"&gt;The company has &lt;strong&gt;offices in Germany, United Kingdom, Romania and France&lt;/strong&gt;, and is backed by renowned institutional investors, including Corsair Capital and Seventure Partners. Its &lt;strong&gt;portfolio of international clients spans a wide range of end markets&lt;/strong&gt; including financial services, telecommunications, travel &amp;amp; mobility, gaming, and other industries.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style="text-align: center;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: center;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This position is based in Rennes, France.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: center;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Solutions Engineer at IDnow is the &lt;strong&gt;client's trusted advisor through pre-sales and integration&lt;/strong&gt;. You design the solution the client will rely on, you give them confidence that it will work in their environment, and you become the person they turn to for technical and solution decisions. &lt;strong&gt;Your focus is the technical side of the journey up to the point where the client is live on our products, and you make that path smooth&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a &lt;strong&gt;hands-on, deeply technical role, and a commercial one&lt;/strong&gt;. Solutions Engineers carry a quota and are measured on two things: the deals they help win, and whether the client goes live successfully. &lt;strong&gt;You work hand in hand with Sales &lt;/strong&gt;to convince the client that our solution is the right one and to move them toward signature, and then you make sure they can use it well in production. You earn that through technical depth, but you are client-facing, credible and persuasive in a sales motion. You do this across our whole client base.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We hire this role at more than one level. The core of the job is the same; the scope you own and the complexity you handle grow with your experience. This role carries real ownership across the client journey, and a say in how the work evolves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-testid="markdown-response"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Discover and Design&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical discovery, qualifying conversion rates, false acceptance and rejection trade-offs, fraud exposure and integration constraints before proposing a solution,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design end-to-end solution architectures that orchestrate document verification, digital identity, fraud signals, biometric authentication, eID and EU Digital Identity Wallet flows, and e-signature,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Link every technical choice to the client’s business objectives and Key Performance Indicators (KPIs), so proposals speak to outcomes rather than features,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define defensible architecture decisions covering fallback logic, data residency, scalability and performance,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Sales with proposals, Requests for Proposal (RFPs) and Requests for Information (RFIs), advising on which capabilities to combine and why.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Prove, Integrate and Go Live&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead proof-of-concept and pilot engagements, configuring Application Programming Interface (API) integrations, building Postman collections and managing sandbox environments,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Validate behaviour under realistic conditions and document what the client needs to go live,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide client developers through API and mobile Software Development Kit (SDK) integration, including webhooks, authentication and testing,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot integration issues by reading logs and diagnosing failures at the API and SDK level, rather than only forwarding them,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a living integration map of the client’s architecture, data flows and dependencies,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the account from signature to go-live, running the go-live plan and handing a documented account to Customer Success and Support at the end of hypercare.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Advise and Enable&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted advisor relationships with business and technical stakeholders, from first conversation to go-live,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent the client’s technical reality internally, feeding integration blockers, product gaps and pilot learnings back to Product and Sales teams,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the internal escalation team on deeper platform issues, arriving with clear technical context,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stand alongside Sales in client meetings, addressing objections on integration effort, feasibility and alternatives,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve demo environments, architecture templates and integration guides, and mentor team members as the practice grows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;section class="container-element section-element editable-element section_with_title-element-57a6ed87-9a65-412d-b52c-7002d3fb072d section_with_title-element-default-section-with-title" data-v-51f33a98="" data-v-fd08594a=""&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section class="container-element section-element editable-element section_with_title-element-7525b616-170d-49ba-8189-de0a0bb7b01f section_with_title-element-default-section-with-title" data-v-51f33a98="" data-v-fd08594a=""&gt;
&lt;div class="editable-element-layer" data-v-607a5d63="" data-v-422f1a2b="" data-v-fd08594a=""&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="text-element editable-element editable-text-element" data-v-fd08594a=""&gt;
&lt;h2 class="text-element-header_text-2"&gt;Preferred Experience&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You ask before you propose and qualify before you demo, turning ambiguous client requirements into the right technical solution. You take ownership of the client’s technical path from first conversation to production, and you explain complex systems in plain language to engineers and business leaders alike. You combine hands-on engineering depth with a commercial mindset, and you enjoy working alongside Sales to move a decision forward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering or technical degree&lt;/strong&gt;, a Master’s degree in a relevant field, or equivalent practical experience,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3+ years of experience in solutions engineering, technical consulting, or implementation and onboarding in SaaS&lt;/strong&gt;, ideally in identity, FinTech or security,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Discovery and qualification skills&lt;/strong&gt;, with the ability to turn an ambiguous client requirement into the best technical solution,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solution architecture skills&lt;/strong&gt;, including designing integration flows, explaining orchestration logic and defending trade-offs with a client’s engineers,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on technical skills&lt;/strong&gt; with APIs, Software Development Kits (SDKs) including &lt;strong&gt;mobile, and integration tooling&lt;/strong&gt; such as Postman and Git,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience running a proof of concept and debugging an integration at the API or log level,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivery discipline to run an integration and onboarding through to a committed go-live date, managing several client projects at once,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to translate technical complexity into plain language and reassure non-technical stakeholders,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business value awareness&lt;/strong&gt;, connecting the technical solution to client outcomes such as verification conversion, fraud loss or time to go-live,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Client-facing presence, building trusted advisor relationships with business stakeholders such as Chief Digital Officers (CDOs) and Heads of Digital, and technical stakeholders such as Chief Technology Officers (CTOs), architects and platform engineers,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The instinct to own the client’s technical path end to end,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluent English and full professional French are both hard requirements for the role.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Additional European languages are a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline;"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with identity verification, Know Your Customer (KYC), Know Your Business (KYB) or Anti-Money Laundering (AML) processes, including document verification, biometrics, liveness detection, eID and fraud detection,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in where digital identity is heading, including eIDAS 2.0, EU Digital Identity Wallets, the EU Anti-Money Laundering Regulation and General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR),&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with mobile SDK delivery on iOS, Android or React Native,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of web development concepts, including frontend and backend architecture, webhooks and Open Authorisation (OAuth),&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in mobility, FinTech, banking or other regulated industries,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of a programming language such as Python, Java or JavaScript, and of a cloud platform such as Amazon Web Services (AWS), Microsoft Azure or Google Cloud Platform (GCP).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Perks &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellbeing:&lt;/strong&gt; Use your full access to the mental health platform &lt;em&gt;nilo&lt;/em&gt;, including 1on1 sessions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We value&lt;strong&gt; personal and professional development:&lt;/strong&gt; make full use of &lt;em&gt;Udemy&lt;/em&gt;, our training platform with 24/7 access and unlimited content/course consumption incl. certification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We make your &lt;strong&gt;remote work comfy:&lt;/strong&gt; we provide support on equipment and offer flexible working hours.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We value collaboration &amp;amp; love to come together: regular&lt;strong&gt; onsite gatherings, internal initiatives&lt;/strong&gt; and summer parties to connect outside of work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;May your family require your attention or other reasons apply: use the benefit of our&lt;strong&gt; paid &lt;/strong&gt;special&lt;strong&gt; leave days.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy the possibility to combine work with a longer stay at your holiday destination or extend a weekend with our&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Workcation possibilities.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In addition to the perks &amp;amp; benefits above, we offer &lt;strong&gt;specific benefits that differ between our locations.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
